tem and a dice system because  um you know what happens is when you  attack people you roll a dice you can  theoretically get a skull and i felt  like having both of those  together might have been a little bit  more in the rng system that i'm willing  to really feel comfortable with but it's  like i said what's crazy is they did  stuff so well where i never felt like i  was annoyed or angry that i rode bad  dice i never felt like i got bad cards  and it frustrated me because they were  constantly rewarding with me with cards  and if you didn't like those cards you  can take those cards and dispose of them  to get more points to go towards  everyone's next cards and keep in mind  that that mechanic is for everyone it's  not just you so if everyone's got cars  that they don't like they can just get  rid of them and it builds that pull for  everyone to get new cars and i really  enjoyed that i think demeo has something  here i think that when they really  determine what they want to do with this  game and i feel like they have but  obviously games will change to a point  and once they feel the you know the  criticism for the community it might  push away a different way but i do feel  like the foundation for this game is  amazing and sure there might not be a  lot of content right now there's three  adventures with three stages on every  adventure and i would say a stage can  take you anywhere from an hour to an  hour and a half depending on how  skillful you are in this game i'm sure  there's some that can do it's quicker  but that's that's a pretty good amount  of content if you look at it that's  that's probably around 10 hours your  first playthrough of every stage and  i've played these stages multiple times  and i never felt like i was burnt out  even playing the same stage back to back  because when you're playing with friends  that's why i felt like you know when you  play with one other person let me  control two people because i can always  have that sensation because i don't  always have to find four people but you  know that's pretty much what i feel  about dmu i definitely feel like it's  worth the asking price for this game  which i'm pretty sure is 30 and the good  part about buying dbo on steam  is if you have friends that's playing  this on vr guess what you could play  with them it's got cross play i don't  know about cross progression i didn't  really see any settings to set anything  like that up but cross play is good i  feel like you know do cross progression  it would be better because you can take  your account from one of you know system  to another it might be on the actual  website i didn't really look too much  into that but crossplay works day one  and i have to give my hats off to an  indie company that could do cross play  more successful than some aaa companies  day one but you know that's pretty much  the dmio for pc review from lord addict  i would definitely say that demio on pc  and on vr in general is iron lord  approved for sure because i really  enjoyed it definitely got the iron step  i really need to make an animation to  put on these videos when i feel like i'm  feeling something man it's getting that  iron lord stamp you know i'm gonna work  on that that's gonna be addict's next  adventure to get that iron stamp emote  to put on these videos but you know  definitely go and buy that game i think  it's worth every penny i really enjoyed  you know the narrative focus that they  give you on here the music that's in  this game i really enjoyed the gameplay  for the most part you know it's like i  said there was some nitpicks i can give  and that's all i really did in this  video was nitpick stuff but everything i  enjoyed i played to its fullest i  probably got 30 40 hours between the pc  version and the vr and i loved every  minute of it and i think i'm going to  start streaming this game because it is  a nice game that you can stream and  interact with your chat now when it came  to the vr i didn't really want to stream  the vr version because vr doesn't really  look the greatest when you stream in my  opinion but i would definitely be  streaming this game i recommend it to  all of you guys and until next time this  is my review on demeo for the pc  particularly the steam version i don't  know if it's on like epic games or  anything like that but it's on the steam  version for 30 dollars and i highly  recommend it and until next time this is  lord adams and i'm outta here peace
 

